  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xE4;ngelsesamarbete-LIT</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prison Programme-LIT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An important element of a democracy is to have well functioning state institutions for upholding the rule of law and the respect for human rights. Development of the lithuanian penitentiary system is therefore of vital importance. The objective is to bring the lithuanian prisons into conformity with EU standards.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fungerande institutioner f&#xF6;r upr&#xE4;tth&#xE5;llande av lag och ordning med respekt f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter &#xE4;r en viktig del av demokratin. Utveckling av det litauiska f&#xE4;ngelsesystemet &#xE4;r d&#xE4;rf&#xF6;r en viktig insats.Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let f&#xF6;r projektet &#xE4;r att den litauiska f&#xE5;ngv&#xE5;rden ska kunna uppfylla EUs krav.</narrative>
  </description>
